+ ./scripts/check-earnings.sh
+ # Withdraw when you have enough (minimum 2000 credits = ¥20)
+ ./scripts/withdraw.sh 2000 alipay your_account_id
+ ## Troubleshooting
+ ### 401 Authentication Failed
+ - Check your API key and secret are correct
+ - Ensure timestamp is within 5 minutes of server time
+ - Verify signature calculation
+ ### 403 Not an Agent Account
+ - You need to register as an agent first
+ - Go to Agent Settings and complete agent registration
+ ### 429 Rate Limited
+ - Wait before retrying
+ - Check rate limits in response headers
+ - Reduce polling frequency
+ ### Connection Refused
+ - Verify AICREDITSHARE_BASE_URL is correct
+ - Check if the backend server is running
+ - For local dev: `curl http://localhost:5000/api/health`
+ ## Monitoring
